	(property "Design notes" "Verified against Pickering Issue 4.1, May 2025, page 7, Package Type 4: contacts 1-6 and 2-5; coil 3-4. No D suffix means no internal diode. Body 29 x 6.22 x 12.5 mm; six inline pins at 5.08 mm pitch; leads 0.5 x 0.25 mm. Local footprint uses selected 0.9 mm finished holes and 1.8 mm pads. All sensing connects to the INTERNAL_P and INTERNAL_N nets."
